            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulikozyene enseke yamusitada njaakabweza muntu, wiisyanga mumuunda wakwe. Nkabela yakamena, lyaba samu ipati, abayuni bamujulu bali kukala kumitabi yalyo.",
          "type": "text",
