        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyooba kulila akuluma ntwino, awo mwabona Abrahamu, a-Izaka, a-Jakobo, abasinsimi boonse, balikede mu-Bwami bwa-Leza, pele nywebo mwasowelwa buyo anze. ",
