                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaka Jerusalemu, Jerusalemu, yebo oojaya basinsimi akubawaala mabwe abatumwa kulinduwe, Kanjikanji ndali kuyanda kubungika antoomwe bana bako, mbuli nkuku mbwiifukatila twana twayo mumababa aayo, pele mwakaka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.34",
