        {
          "text": "Amubone, iŋanda yanu mwiilekelelwa kiimwaikide. Eno ndamwaambila kuti, Tamukooyoondibona limbi, mane mukaambe kuti, Uli acoolwe uuboola muzina lya-Jehova.",
